      Observe that, tending $k\rightarrow\infty$, for $\{x+\epsilon_{k}r_{k_{j}}-y_{k_{j}}\}$ is bounded 
      and $\lim\limits_{k\rightarrow\infty}\epsilon_{k}=0$,
      we can conclude that $\langle Ax,x-v^*\rangle\geq0,~\forall x\in C$. This implies that $v^*\in S_D$.
    \end{case}

